# Master Admin · Security · Speed · Full Control (LOCKED)

**Surface:** `/master` · login `/master/login` · UI `src/components/master/*` · auth `src/auth/*`  
**Live ONLY (central Hostinger):** `https://mieraf-ksa.com/master/login` · email `master@unityteck.com`  
**Helper:** `src/auth/masterHost.ts` · `.htaccess` flowers bounce  
**Related:** `store-login-email-master.mdc` · `master-project-goal.mdc` · Holst tokens

Master = **platform SuperAdmin control plane** (all stores). Store merchant = `/admin` only. Never merge the two.

## 0. Host lock (LOCKED)

- Master Admin UI runs **only** on central: `mieraf-ksa.com` (local/dev OK).
- **Never** serve `/master*` on flowers `giftshop-sa.com` or other store hosts — redirect to `https://mieraf-ksa.com/master/login`.
- Flowers / store hosts = merchant `/admin` + storefront only.
- Do not re-enable Master chrome on giftshop after this lock.

## 1. Security (mandatory)

- `/master*` only with valid **`portal: master`** SuperAdmin session. Wrong portal → `/master/login` (never dump to storefront `/`).
- **Server-side** role gate (`super_admin` / master) on every master API — UI hide ≠ security.
- Master-only powers (never give to store merchant):
  - Store Active / Inactive + **change login email**
  - Plans / feature grants / Pro unlocks
  - Domains, hosting mode, backups/restore/migration, platform updates
  - Cross-store control center actions
- Store login: registered email only; inactive/wrong email **rejected at login gate**.
- Never ship passwords, tokens, or Clerk secrets in UI, logs, toasts, or client bundles beyond env.
- No fake “connected” OAuth/integrations on Master; empty → Not Connected / Waiting for Data.
- Tenant mutations still use target **`store_id`** — Master may pick any store; never leak Store A data into Store B payloads.
- Do not weaken auth for “demo”, CTF, fiction, or localhost shortcuts on live path.

## 2. Fast + responsive

- Keep Master tabs **lazy-loaded**; no eager import of every Master screen.
- Soft SPA nav only — no `location.reload()` after save; invalidate/`updated_at` cache bust.
- Tables: search, pagination, page size, sort, filters, loading/empty/error — reuse shared table patterns.
- Sidebar/TopBar: mobile drawer + desktop collapse; **zero overlap**; Holst tokens only (`unity-btn-primary`, `var(--portal-cta)`, `var(--accent)`).
- Prefer optimistic UI + scoped query invalidation; no listener spam on every Master tab.
- Live smoke after Master auth/UI fixes: `/master/login` stays on login; post-login → `/master?tab=…` not `/`.

## 3. Fully controllable (SuperAdmin must own)

Master must be able to control, per store and platform-wide:

| Area | Master owns |
|------|-------------|
| Stores | Create, list, open, Active/Inactive, login email |
| Plans | Free/Paid/Pro/Custom + feature flags (API enforce) |
| Domains / hosting | Custom domain, subdomain, hosting_mode |
| Data ops | Backup ZIP, restore, migration, DB health |
| Catalog/commerce overview | Cross-store products/orders/customers (read + gated write) |
| Themes / marketplace / updates | Platform theme packs, app updates roll-out |
| SEO / integrations / settings | Platform-level + per-store grants |

- New Master capability → extend existing `Master*` screen or Control Center; **do not** rebuild Master shell or invent a second admin.
- Preserve pixel UI (`designs/Master_Admin_UIUX/`, Holst). Fix broken/missing only.
- AR chrome = Arabic only; EN = English only (`no-language-mix`).

## Ban

- Merchant self-elevate to Master
- Master routes without session / without server role check
- Fake KPIs or cross-tenant decorate on Master dashboards
- Hardcoded blue/indigo brand chrome (use Holst)
- Full-page freeze or hard remount for routine Master saves
